# Null Registry checkpoint signing key (NRS-C-0.1) — Ed25519 public identity.
#
# This is a PLACEHOLDER. The real `ed25519:...` identity is written here
# automatically by the first run of registry/scripts/checkpoint.js once the
# private key is set as the GitHub Actions secret CHECKPOINT_KEY_PEM (see
# spec/CHECKPOINT.md, "The signing key"). Until then, no checkpoint exists and
# verify-checkpoint.js treats the log as an empty genesis state.
#
# Once populated, this file pins the one key permitted to sign the log, so any
# clone can confirm which key it is trusting. Do not hand-edit the identity line.
